  "details": "1. Leave the VRChat Client running for an unknown long time (on the scale of 24-48+ hours)\n\n2. Select an avatar with expressions\n\n3. Open Quick Menu or Main Menu Expressions Wing\n\n4. Observe missing labels for expressions (both leaf and container nodes)\n\nExpression labels are notably *present* in the Radial Menu.\n\nThe absence of labels persists between world and avatar changes.\n\nAs this bug occurs after many hours, and as I only updated to build 1583 today, but no such bug was mentioned in the patch notes for build 1583, I am still submitting this report.",
